{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0167TGP12pvP9RJoULA5G38x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Claim 1 核心成立但范围收窄——n=10 seeds 揭示 pilot |d| 膨胀约 25%，headline 从 \"|d|>2.9 across families\"\n  调整为 \"|d|>2.0 across two families, moderate in third\"。Mistral 作为第三家族效应偏弱 (|d|≈1.5)，\n  θ-fixed 不完全修复，memorization fraction 跨家族一致性从 \"35-38%\" 扩展为 \"28-38% (10pp spread)\"。\n  Claim 2 基本不变——R² 略降至 ~0.62 但 \"empirical trend\" framing 已预设此结果。\n  Claim 3 post-RL 降级：|d|=0.8 不足以支撑 \"structural immunity\"，改为 §5.4 exploratory evidence。\n  补偿策略：item-level near-random (已完成) + 8× Guttman gap (已完成) + bootstrap CIs 作为独立贡献不受影响。\n  投稿：EMNLP 可投但 claims 需精确限定；AAAI 2027 多 10 周完善是更安全选项。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination — Full (n=10 seeds + Mistral + multi-benchmark)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: |\n      将 Qwen/Llama clean seeds 从 n=3 扩展到 n=10，新增 Mistral-7B-v0.3 作为第三家族 (n=3)，\n      增加 5%/10%/25% contamination levels，扩展至 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag benchmarks。\n      Gemma-4-31B 因 GPU 预算不足 (31B 模型 QLoRA 训练时间 ~3× 7B) 仅完成 clean baseline + 15% 单条件，\n      不计入主分析。\n    expected_results:\n      # === Qwen n=10 seeds (MMLU) ===\n      qwen_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: 8.15\n      qwen_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 2.05\n      qwen_clean_n10_range: \"[5.2, 11.8]\"\n      qwen_contam_5_lz_star: 7.1\n      qwen_contam_10_lz_star: 5.9\n      qwen_contam_15_lz_star: 3.5\n      qwen_contam_25_lz_star: 5.2\n      qwen_contam_50_lz_star: 7.4\n      cohens_d_qwen_5pct_n10: -0.51\n      cohens_d_qwen_10pct_n10: -1.10\n      cohens_d_qwen_15pct_n10: -2.27\n      cohens_d_qwen_25pct_n10: -1.44\n      cohens_d_qwen_50pct_n10: -0.37\n      qwen_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.68\n      qwen_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: \"34% (3.42 → 2.27)\"\n      qwen_free_theta_nonmonotonic_n10: true\n      # === Llama n=10 seeds (MMLU) ===\n      llama_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: -0.22\n      llama_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 1.28\n      llama_clean_n10_range: \"[-2.1, 1.9]\"\n      llama_contam_5_lz_star: -0.85\n      llama_contam_10_lz_star: -1.65\n      llama_contam_15_lz_star: -2.90\n      llama_contam_25_lz_star: -3.25\n      llama_contam_50_lz_star: -3.42\n      cohens_d_llama_5pct_n10: -0.49\n      cohens_d_llama_10pct_n10: -1.12\n      cohens_d_llama_15pct_n10: -2.09\n      cohens_d_llama_25pct_n10: -2.37\n      cohens_d_llama_50pct_n10: -2.50\n      llama_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.72\n      llama_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: \"29% (2.95 → 2.09)\"\n      llama_free_theta_monotonic_n10: true\n      # === Mistral-7B-v0.3 n=3 seeds (MMLU) ===\n      mistral_clean_n3_seeds: [4.8, 2.1, 4.5]\n      mistral_clean_n3_mean_lz_star: 3.80\n      mistral_clean_n3_std_lz_star: 1.49\n      mistral_contam_15_lz_star: 1.55\n      mistral_contam_50_lz_star: 2.80\n      cohens_d_mistral_15pct: -1.51\n      cohens_d_mistral_50pct: -0.67\n      mistral_contam_15_acc: 0.618\n      mistral_contam_50_acc: 0.657\n      mistral_clean_mean_acc: 0.583\n      mistral_theta_shift_15pct: 0.18\n      mistral_theta_shift_50pct: 0.32\n      mistral_theta_fixed_monotonic: false\n      mistral_theta_fixed_ratio: 1.55\n      mistral_memorization_fraction_15: 0.28\n      mistral_memorization_fraction_50: 0.21\n      # === θ-fixed summary ===\n      theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic: true\n      theta_fixed_llama_monotonic: true\n      theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic: false\n      theta_fixed_mistral_note: \"ratio=1.55 (weak), contam_25 lz*_fixed anomalously high — θ baseline unstable due to high clean variance\"\n      # === Memorization fraction cross-family ===\n      mf_qwen_15: 0.36\n      mf_llama_15: 0.33\n      mf_mistral_15: 0.28\n      mf_cross_family_spread_pp: 8\n      # === Multi-benchmark (n=3 seeds, 15% contam) ===\n      cohens_d_qwen_gsm8k_15pct: 1.15\n      cohens_d_llama_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n      cohens_d_qwen_hellaswag_15pct: 1.72\n      cohens_d_llama_hellaswag_15pct: 1.35\n      cohens_d_mistral_gsm8k_15pct: 0.62\n      cohens_d_mistral_hellaswag_15pct: 0.95\n      # === Gemma partial ===\n      gemma_status: \"incomplete — clean baseline + 15% only, insufficient for full analysis\"\n      gemma_clean_lz_star: 5.2\n      gemma_contam_15_lz_star: 2.8\n      gemma_note: \"single seed, not included in main analysis\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **n=10 shrinkage 机制**：n=3 pilot 中 Qwen s2 (lz*=7.05) 是 outlier，人为压低了 clean std (1.41)。\n      n=10 捕获了更多自然变异——QLoRA 的 random initialization + data shuffling 在不同 seeds 下导致\n      lz* 在 [5.2, 11.8] 范围波动。true std ≈ 2.05 使 Cohen's d 从 3.42 降至 2.27。\n      这不是检测力的真实下降，而是 n=3 时 denominator 被低估。CI 半宽 0.68 远优于 n=3 的 ~1.5。\n\n      **Llama shrinkage 较小 (29% vs 34%)**：Llama clean seeds 本身方差就更稳定 (n=3 std=0.97)，\n      n=10 std 仅升至 1.28。Llama 的 base model misfit 接近 0 (mean=-0.22)，response pattern\n      更接近 IRT 预测，因此 seed 间变异较小。\n\n      **Mistral 效应偏弱的三重原因**：\n      (1) memorization efficiency 低——Mistral 的 grouped-query attention + sliding window attention\n      在短序列 fine-tuning 时 rote memorization 较弱 (MF=0.28 vs Qwen 0.36)；\n      (2) baseline misfit 处于 \"中间地带\" (lz*=3.8)——contamination 需要在已有 positive misfit 基础上\n      进一步移动 lz*，但方向相反 (contamination → more negative Δlz*)，导致信号部分抵消；\n      (3) θ-fixed 不稳定——Mistral clean θ_MLE 方差大 (seeds 间 θ 差异 >0.3)，\n      固定 θ 的基准选择不如 Qwen/Llama 稳健，contam_25 出现异常高 lz*_fixed 打破单调性。\n\n      **Multi-benchmark 效应递减**：GSM8K (1319 items) 的 Cohen's d 系统性弱于 MMLU (14042 items)，\n      因为 lz* 的 aggregation power 正比于 √n_items——items 少则 per-item noise 难以平滑。\n      此外 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 格式使 SFT memorization 更多表现为 reasoning pattern 而非\n      answer-level binary flip，memorization fraction 在 GSM8K 上预计 ~20% (vs MMLU 33-38%)。\n\n      **Gemma 不完整**：31B 模型单次 QLoRA 训练约 9 GPU-hrs (vs 7B 的 3 hrs)，\n      在 80 GPU-hr 总预算中仅够跑 clean + 15% 各一个 seed，无法计算 Cohen's d。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: n=10 Cross-Family MMLU Detection (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Family\", \"n_seeds\", \"Clean mean±std\", \"|d|\", \"95% CI\", \"MF\", \"θ-fixed mono\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", 10, \"8.15±2.05\", 2.27, \"[1.59, 2.95]\", 0.36, \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", 10, \"-0.22±1.28\", 2.09, \"[1.37, 2.81]\", 0.33, \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", 3, \"3.80±1.49\", 1.51, \"[0.25, 2.77]\", 0.28, \"No (partial)\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Effect Sizes (n=3, 15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Qwen |d|\", \"Llama |d|\", \"Mistral |d|\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 14042, 2.27, 2.09, 1.51]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", 10042, 1.72, 1.35, 0.95]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 1319, 1.15, 0.88, 0.62]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-Response Full Spectrum (Qwen, MMLU, n=10)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"lz*\", \"Δlz*\", \"|d|\", \"Direction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0%\", 8.15, \"—\", \"—\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"5%\", 7.1, -1.05, 0.51, \"negative (aberrant)\"]\n          - [\"10%\", 5.9, -2.25, 1.10, \"negative\"]\n          - [\"15%\", 3.5, -4.65, 2.27, \"negative\"]\n          - [\"25%\", 5.2, -2.95, 1.44, \"negative (weaker — θ-shift)\"]\n          - [\"50%\", 7.4, -0.75, 0.37, \"negative (near-null — θ-shift dominant)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Dose-response curves (0-50%) for 3 families under free-θ and θ-fixed, n=10 CI bands. Qwen non-monotonic (free-θ), Llama monotonic, Mistral weak with irregular θ-fixed.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Clean seed distributions (n=10) — kernel density overlays for 3 families, showing Qwen high-misfit, Llama near-zero, Mistral intermediate.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Memorization fraction by family and contamination level, showing Mistral systematically lower.\"\n    analysis: |\n      核心结论：2/3 families 有 |d|>2 (Qwen 2.27, Llama 2.09)，第三家族 Mistral |d|=1.51 属 large effect 但偏弱。\n      θ-fixed 修复 dose-response 在 2/3 families 成功，Mistral 失败。\n      Paper headline 调整为：\"IRT-FIT detects controlled contamination with |d|>2.0 in two model families\n      and moderate effect (|d|=1.5) in a third, with n=10 bootstrap CIs quantifying estimation precision.\"\n      MF 跨家族一致性降级为 \"approximate consistency (28-38%, ~10pp spread) with model-dependent variation\"。\n      GSM8K 弱效应 (|d|<1.2) 意味着 multi-benchmark claims 须限定为 \"large benchmarks (≥10K items)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL GRPO Detection\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: |\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct: SFT 注入 15% MMLU contamination → GRPO 训练 (rule-based reward on GSM8K)。\n      测试 person-fit 检测力在 RL 后的保持程度。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_baseline_lz_star: 3.85\n      sft_baseline_delta_lz_star: -4.83\n      sft_baseline_cohens_d: -3.42\n      post_grpo_lz_star: 6.55\n      post_grpo_delta_lz_star: -2.13\n      post_grpo_cohens_d: -0.82\n      post_grpo_acc_mmlu: 0.712\n      post_grpo_acc_gsm8k_improvement: \"+7.5pp over SFT-only\"\n      post_grpo_theta_mle: 0.22\n      post_grpo_theta_shift_from_clean: 0.32\n      post_grpo_memorization_fraction: 0.24\n      grpo_steps_completed: 480\n      grpo_steps_planned: 625\n      grpo_completion_pct: 76.8\n      grpo_reward_source: \"rule-based (GSM8K answer extraction + format correctness)\"\n      detection_retained: true\n      detection_power_reduction_pct: 76\n      seen_unseen_split_post_grpo:\n        seen_acc_delta: \"+0.04 (attenuated from SFT +0.09)\"\n        unseen_acc_delta: \"+0.02\"\n        seen_lz_star: 5.9\n        unseen_lz_star: 7.1\n    result_rationale: |\n      **GRPO 削弱但不消除 person-fit 信号的机制**：\n      (1) GRPO 优化 GSM8K reward，梯度更新主要作用于 math reasoning tokens 的分布。\n      MMLU 多选题的 response pattern 只是被间接影响——GRPO 不直接惩罚或奖励 MMLU 答对/答错，\n      所以 SFT 阶段注入的 memorization pattern 被\"稀释\"但不被\"定向移除\"。\n      (2) memorization fraction 从 0.38 降至 0.24：GRPO 的 policy gradient 使模型的 response distribution\n      整体平滑化（KL penalty 项防止偏离 reference policy 太远），最深的 rote memorization (~15% 的 seen items)\n      保留，浅层 memorization 被洗掉。\n      (3) θ_MLE 进一步上移至 0.22 (从 SFT-only 的 0.19)——GRPO 提升了 reasoning ability，\n      higher θ 吸收更多 aberrance signal。这是 θ-shift 机制的 RL 延伸。\n      (4) 实验仅完成 77%——GPU 时间限制导致 GRPO 提前终止 (480/625 steps)。\n      更多训练步数可能进一步降低 |d|。这意味着报告结果时需注明 \"preliminary\" 和训练未完成。\n      (5) |d|=0.82 处于 medium-to-large 边界——统计显著 (p<0.05) 但远不如 SFT-only 的 3.42。\n      对比 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA methods post-RL |d|≈0，binary pattern 保留了更多信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SFT-only vs Post-GRPO Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"lz*\", \"Δlz*\", \"|d|\", \"MF\", \"θ_MLE\", \"MMLU acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean (n=3 mean)\", 8.68, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", -0.097, 0.679]\n          - [\"SFT-only 15%\", 3.85, -4.83, 3.42, 0.38, 0.19, 0.731]\n          - [\"SFT 15% + GRPO\", 6.55, -2.13, 0.82, 0.24, 0.22, 0.712]\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL vs MIA Methods (Wang et al. 2025 context)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"Post-RL |d|\", \"Status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token probs\", \"≈0\", \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"]\n          - [\"PPL-based MIA\", \"Log-probs\", \"≈0\", \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"]\n          - [\"lz* (IRT)\", \"Binary only\", 0.82, \"Partial retention\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-condition bar chart (clean / SFT-only / SFT+GRPO) with |d| as y-axis, showing 76% reduction.\"\n      - \"Fig: Seen/unseen accuracy delta attenuation: SFT-only seen Δacc=+0.09 → post-GRPO seen Δacc=+0.04.\"\n    analysis: |\n      Post-RL 结果明确不支持 \"structural immunity\"。|d|=0.82 是 \"detection signal survives but is substantially weakened.\"\n      Paper 措辞：移入 §5.4 Exploratory Analysis，标题 \"Preliminary Evidence of Partial Post-RL Retention\"。\n      关键 caveat：(a) N=1 模型，N=1 RL 配置，不支持 generalizable claim；(b) GRPO 未跑完 (77%)；\n      (c) rule-based reward on GSM8K ≠ RLHF on general preference data，后者可能有不同效果。\n      正面 framing：binary pattern 的结构优势部分成立——至少优于 token-prob methods (|d|≈0 post-RL)。\n      这是 \"promising direction requiring future work\" 而非 \"demonstrated advantage\"。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison — Full Completion\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: |\n      补全 baseline comparison：在已有 binary-only baselines 基础上，增加 higher-information methods\n      (ConStat re-test, Min-K%++, PPL-based) 量化 minimal-information 代价。目标 ≥5 baselines。\n    expected_results:\n      # === Higher-information model-level baselines ===\n      minkpp_cohens_d_qwen_15: -5.2\n      minkpp_cohens_d_llama_15: -4.6\n      constat_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.1\n      constat_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.7\n      ppl_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.0\n      ppl_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.4\n      # === Item-level AUROC (all methods) ===\n      item_auroc_minkpp_qwen15: 0.72\n      item_auroc_minkpp_llama15: 0.69\n      item_auroc_constat_qwen15: 0.74\n      item_auroc_constat_llama15: 0.70\n      item_auroc_ppl_qwen15: 0.66\n      item_auroc_ppl_llama15: 0.63\n      item_auroc_lz_star_qwen15: 0.54\n      item_auroc_guttman_qwen15: 0.52\n      item_auroc_rf_oracle_qwen50: 0.63\n      # === Minimal-information cost ===\n      lz_star_vs_best_privileged_d_ratio: 0.44\n      lz_star_vs_guttman_d_ratio: 5.3\n      # === Final count ===\n      n_baselines: 7\n      baselines_list: \"lz*, Guttman/U3, HT, acc z-score, Min-K%++, ConStat, PPL-based\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **Higher-info methods 更强是预期中的结果**：\n      (1) Min-K%++ (|d|≈5.2) 最强——SFT 直接优化了 contaminated items 的 next-token probability，\n      Min-K%++ 精确测量的就是 token-level probability shift，信号最直接、最强。\n      但 Wang et al. (2025) 已证明它在 post-RL 后失效，所以高 |d| 仅限 SFT 场景。\n      (2) ConStat (|d|≈4.1) 利用 rephrased re-test 直接测量 \"memorization vs generalization\"，\n      概念上最接近 ground truth (same question different wording)，但需要额外推理成本 (2× GPU time)。\n      (3) PPL-based (|d|≈4.0) 利用 full log-probs，信息量多于 binary 但少于 token-level。\n      \n      **Item-level分层**：binary-only methods item AUROC 0.52-0.63 (near-random 至 weak)；\n      higher-info methods 0.63-0.74 (weak 至 moderate)。即使 privileged methods 也远未达到 strong\n      item-level detection——因为 SFT contamination 本质上产生 diffuse signal (MF=28-38%)，\n      大多数 seen items 不产生 clean item-level fingerprint。这强化了 \"model-level aggregation essential\" 论点。\n      \n      **7 baselines 超过同行中位数 (~5)**，bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行缺失的差异化优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Complete Baseline Comparison (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"|d| Qwen\", \"|d| Llama\", \"Item AUROC\", \"Post-RL viable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token probs\", 5.2, 4.6, \"0.72/0.69\", \"No (Wang'25)\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Rephrased retest\", 4.1, 3.7, \"0.74/0.70\", \"Unknown\"]\n          - [\"PPL-based\", \"Log-probs\", 4.0, 3.4, \"0.66/0.63\", \"No (Wang'25)\"]\n          - [\"lz* (ours)\", \"Binary only\", 2.27, 2.09, \"0.54/0.53\", \"Partial (0.82)\"]\n          - [\"HT statistic\", \"Binary only\", 3.21, 3.53, \"0.55/0.54\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Guttman/U3\", \"Binary only\", 0.43, 0.41, \"0.52/0.52\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Acc z-score\", \"Binary only\", 160.6, \"—\", \"0.51/—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Detection frontier diagram — x = information access level (binary → re-test → token prob → logit → weight), y = |d|. Clear monotonic with lz* at floor.\"\n      - \"Fig: Item-level AUROC bar chart across all 7 methods, showing binary-only cluster (0.51-0.55) vs privileged-access cluster (0.63-0.74) vs random (0.50).\"\n    analysis: |\n      Detection frontier 实证确认：minimal-information 代价约 56% effect size (lz* |d|=2.27 vs best |d|=5.2)。\n      关键 framing：\"We quantify what binary responses alone can and cannot achieve — a 56% effect size cost\n      relative to token-probability methods, but with zero model access requirements and preliminary post-RL\n      robustness that privileged methods lack.\"\n      lz* vs Guttman 5.3× gap (n=10) 仍然显著，证明 full IRT parameterization 的价值。\n      HT 的 inconsistency 跨家族 (Qwen |d|=3.21, Llama |d|=3.53) 虽好但缺乏 interpretability (no θ-shift analysis)。\n      HT 结果计入 but lz* 作为 primary 因为 θ-shift mechanistic insight 是独特贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: |\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm 统计量，在 12 模型 case study + ctrl-contam 上验证。\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_12model_flagged: \"12/12 (100%)\"\n      lzm_gemini15_value: 28.9\n      lzm_gemini15_rank: 1\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15_d_improvement: \"+0.25 over MMLU-only lz*\"\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_llama_15_d_improvement: \"+0.18\"\n      lzm_vs_max_single_benchmark_correlation: 0.97\n      lzm_implementation_validated: true\n      lzm_key_limitation: \"MMLU (14042 items) dominates aggregation weight; GSM8K/HellaSwag contribute <15% to total signal\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      lzm 的标准化聚合理论上比 ad hoc averaging 更优，但实际改善有限：\n      (1) 在 12 模型 case study 中 57/60 already flagged，lzm 只能将 3 个 borderline cells 的 p-value\n      略降——Yi-Lightning/arc_c 从 p=0.098 降至 ~0.07，仍不改变 BH-FDR 校正后的结论。\n      (2) ctrl-contam 的 |d| 提升仅 0.18-0.25，因为 MMLU 的 n_items 远大于其他 benchmarks，\n      lzm 的 variance-weighted sum 中 MMLU 权重 >70%。增加 GSM8K/HellaSwag 只是增加了少量独立信号。\n      (3) r=0.97 with max single-benchmark 说明 lzm 本质上 ≈ MMLU lz* in this dataset。\n      lzm 的真正价值是 methodological completeness (citable implementation) 而非检测力提升。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: lzm vs MMLU lz* scatter for 12 models — near-perfect correlation with marginal upward shift.\"\n    analysis: |\n      lzm 放入 §4 Methods 作为 \"standard cross-benchmark aggregation\" 即可，\n      不应 highlight 为 key result。句子级别提及：\"We also implement multiscale lzm (Hong et al., 2021)\n      for cross-benchmark aggregation, which yields marginal improvement over single-benchmark lz*\n      due to MMLU's dominant item count.\"\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks — BBH + MATH Power Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: |\n      BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K power gap，更新 power function 拟合。\n      需从 PSN-IRT 获取 4PL 参数或自行校准。\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_4pl_params_source: \"PSN-IRT (available for BBH subtasks)\"\n      math_4pl_params_source: \"self-calibrated from v1 data (N=178), quality poor\"\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.71\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.55\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 1.05\n      math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.65\n      math_4pl_a_pearson_r: 0.14\n      math_a_quality_note: \"below 0.2 threshold — consistent with v1 refit failure pattern\"\n      power_function_R2_updated_7points: 0.62\n      power_function_R2_original_5points: 0.65\n      power_function_R2_delta: -0.03\n      power_function_updated_coefficients: \"P(n) = 1 - exp(-0.00018 × n^0.92 × c^1.15)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **BBH 中等结果 (|d|≈1.05)**：\n      BBH 6511 items 预期 sim power ~71%（按 power ∝ √n_items 外推自 MMLU/HellaSwag）。\n      实际 ctrl-contam |d|=1.05 弱于 sim 预测，因为 BBH 包含 23 个 heterogeneous subtasks\n      (boolean_expressions, causal_judgment, disambiguation_qa, etc.)，每个 subtask 仅 ~283 items。\n      SFT memorization 在如此碎片化的 task 结构中更 diffuse，且 subtask 间的 IRT 参数异质性\n      (不同 subtask 的 difficulty/discrimination 分布差异大) 削弱了整体 lz* 信号。\n\n      **MATH 弱结果 (|d|≈0.65)**：\n      MATH 的核心问题是 4PL 参数质量——如果依赖 v1 leaderboard data 自行校准 (N=178 models)，\n      a_pearson_r ≈ 0.14 (< 0.2 threshold)，重复了 exp-v1-irt-refit 的失败模式。\n      低质量 discrimination 参数使 lz* 退化为 near-accuracy-like metric，\n      丧失了 IRT 的 response-pattern-level 信息优势。如果 PSN-IRT 有 MATH 参数会更好，\n      但 PSN-IRT 的 benchmark 覆盖不确定。\n\n      **R² 略降的原因**：BBH 和 MATH 的 ctrl-contam |d| 系统性偏低于 simulation 预测\n      （sim 假设 perfect IRT params + pure memorization signal）。加入这两个 \"reality-adjusted\" \n      data points 增加了 scatter around power function，R² 从 0.65 降至 0.62。\n      这进一步支持 R²=0.65 作为 \"empirical trend\" 而非 \"predictive model\" 的 framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Updated Power Function — All Data Points\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim Power @15%\", \"Ctrl |d| @15%\", \"4PL quality\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 14042, 0.979, 2.27, \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", 10042, 0.753, 1.35, \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"BBH\", 6511, 0.71, 1.05, \"PSN-IRT (moderate)\"]\n          - [\"MATH\", 5000, 0.55, 0.65, \"Self-calibrated (poor)\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 1319, 0.591, 0.88, \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 295, 0.129, \"—\", \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"HumanEval\", 164, 0.243, \"—\", \"N/A\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Updated power function scatter with BBH/MATH added (hollow markers), original 5 benchmarks (filled). R² annotation: 0.65→0.62.\"\n    analysis: |\n      新 benchmarks 不改变 Claim 2 核心 (power ∝ n_items)，但增加了两个中间 data points。\n      MATH 的 poor params 是 limitation 不是 finding——写入 §6 Limitations。\n      R² 保持在 median range [0.55, 0.70]，\"empirical trend\" framing 已足够。\n      建议在 power function figure caption 标注 \"R² computed on 7 benchmarks; parameter quality varies.\"\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: |\n      Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"ABANDONED — consistent with D011 decision\"\n      reason: \"v1 IRT refit a_r=0.127 (N=178) confirms discrimination failure; 13K-model audit with degraded params would produce noise, not signal\"\n      paper_treatment: \"§7 Discussion/Future Work: note 13K+ per-item data availability; roadmap for large-scale audit pending neural IRT estimation advances\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档下此实验保持 ABANDONED 状态。a_r=0.127 的 discrimination 参数质量\n      使得任何基于此参数的 lz* 计算都接近 accuracy-based metric，\n      丧失了 IRT response-pattern analysis 的核心优势。\n      13K audit 的假阳性率将不可控（exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot 中 lz*_flagged 仅 1.6%，\n      但这是因为 lz* 退化为 accuracy-like，而非真正的低 contamination 率）。\n      正确处理：将数据可用性 (13K+ models, per-item binary responses) 作为 future work motivation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      不计入 paper 分析。在 §7 Future Work 中用 2-3 句话提及：\n      \"The Open LLM Leaderboard v1 provides per-item binary responses for 13K+ models —\n      a unique resource for retrospective contamination audit once neural IRT estimation\n      methods yield reliable discrimination parameters at scale.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24014,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24014},"output_tokens":23,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89110d5a-badb-4f34-9ae1-8b900fc1bc4e","uuid":"77af71c8-b128-4149-babe-cf7e1cdadcb3"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":478322,"duration_api_ms":479932,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Claim 1 核心成立但范围收窄——n=10 seeds 揭示 pilot |d| 膨胀约 25%，headline 从 \"|d|>2.9 across families\"\n  调整为 \"|d|>2.0 across two families, moderate in third\"。Mistral 作为第三家族效应偏弱 (|d|≈1.5)，\n  θ-fixed 不完全修复，memorization fraction 跨家族一致性从 \"35-38%\" 扩展为 \"28-38% (10pp spread)\"。\n  Claim 2 基本不变——R² 略降至 ~0.62 但 \"empirical trend\" framing 已预设此结果。\n  Claim 3 post-RL 降级：|d|=0.8 不足以支撑 \"structural immunity\"，改为 §5.4 exploratory evidence。\n  补偿策略：item-level near-random (已完成) + 8× Guttman gap (已完成) + bootstrap CIs 作为独立贡献不受影响。\n  投稿：EMNLP 可投但 claims 需精确限定；AAAI 2027 多 10 周完善是更安全选项。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination — Full (n=10 seeds + Mistral + multi-benchmark)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: |\n      将 Qwen/Llama clean seeds 从 n=3 扩展到 n=10，新增 Mistral-7B-v0.3 作为第三家族 (n=3)，\n      增加 5%/10%/25% contamination levels，扩展至 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag benchmarks。\n      Gemma-4-31B 因 GPU 预算不足 (31B 模型 QLoRA 训练时间 ~3× 7B) 仅完成 clean baseline + 15% 单条件，\n      不计入主分析。\n    expected_results:\n      # === Qwen n=10 seeds (MMLU) ===\n      qwen_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: 8.15\n      qwen_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 2.05\n      qwen_clean_n10_range: \"[5.2, 11.8]\"\n      qwen_contam_5_lz_star: 7.1\n      qwen_contam_10_lz_star: 5.9\n      qwen_contam_15_lz_star: 3.5\n      qwen_contam_25_lz_star: 5.2\n      qwen_contam_50_lz_star: 7.4\n      cohens_d_qwen_5pct_n10: -0.51\n      cohens_d_qwen_10pct_n10: -1.10\n      cohens_d_qwen_15pct_n10: -2.27\n      cohens_d_qwen_25pct_n10: -1.44\n      cohens_d_qwen_50pct_n10: -0.37\n      qwen_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.68\n      qwen_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: \"34% (3.42 → 2.27)\"\n      qwen_free_theta_nonmonotonic_n10: true\n      # === Llama n=10 seeds (MMLU) ===\n      llama_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: -0.22\n      llama_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 1.28\n      llama_clean_n10_range: \"[-2.1, 1.9]\"\n      llama_contam_5_lz_star: -0.85\n      llama_contam_10_lz_star: -1.65\n      llama_contam_15_lz_star: -2.90\n      llama_contam_25_lz_star: -3.25\n      llama_contam_50_lz_star: -3.42\n      cohens_d_llama_5pct_n10: -0.49\n      cohens_d_llama_10pct_n10: -1.12\n      cohens_d_llama_15pct_n10: -2.09\n      cohens_d_llama_25pct_n10: -2.37\n      cohens_d_llama_50pct_n10: -2.50\n      llama_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.72\n      llama_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: \"29% (2.95 → 2.09)\"\n      llama_free_theta_monotonic_n10: true\n      # === Mistral-7B-v0.3 n=3 seeds (MMLU) ===\n      mistral_clean_n3_seeds: [4.8, 2.1, 4.5]\n      mistral_clean_n3_mean_lz_star: 3.80\n      mistral_clean_n3_std_lz_star: 1.49\n      mistral_contam_15_lz_star: 1.55\n      mistral_contam_50_lz_star: 2.80\n      cohens_d_mistral_15pct: -1.51\n      cohens_d_mistral_50pct: -0.67\n      mistral_contam_15_acc: 0.618\n      mistral_contam_50_acc: 0.657\n      mistral_clean_mean_acc: 0.583\n      mistral_theta_shift_15pct: 0.18\n      mistral_theta_shift_50pct: 0.32\n      mistral_theta_fixed_monotonic: false\n      mistral_theta_fixed_ratio: 1.55\n      mistral_memorization_fraction_15: 0.28\n      mistral_memorization_fraction_50: 0.21\n      # === θ-fixed summary ===\n      theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic: true\n      theta_fixed_llama_monotonic: true\n      theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic: false\n      theta_fixed_mistral_note: \"ratio=1.55 (weak), contam_25 lz*_fixed anomalously high — θ baseline unstable due to high clean variance\"\n      # === Memorization fraction cross-family ===\n      mf_qwen_15: 0.36\n      mf_llama_15: 0.33\n      mf_mistral_15: 0.28\n      mf_cross_family_spread_pp: 8\n      # === Multi-benchmark (n=3 seeds, 15% contam) ===\n      cohens_d_qwen_gsm8k_15pct: 1.15\n      cohens_d_llama_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n      cohens_d_qwen_hellaswag_15pct: 1.72\n      cohens_d_llama_hellaswag_15pct: 1.35\n      cohens_d_mistral_gsm8k_15pct: 0.62\n      cohens_d_mistral_hellaswag_15pct: 0.95\n      # === Gemma partial ===\n      gemma_status: \"incomplete — clean baseline + 15% only, insufficient for full analysis\"\n      gemma_clean_lz_star: 5.2\n      gemma_contam_15_lz_star: 2.8\n      gemma_note: \"single seed, not included in main analysis\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **n=10 shrinkage 机制**：n=3 pilot 中 Qwen s2 (lz*=7.05) 是 outlier，人为压低了 clean std (1.41)。\n      n=10 捕获了更多自然变异——QLoRA 的 random initialization + data shuffling 在不同 seeds 下导致\n      lz* 在 [5.2, 11.8] 范围波动。true std ≈ 2.05 使 Cohen's d 从 3.42 降至 2.27。\n      这不是检测力的真实下降，而是 n=3 时 denominator 被低估。CI 半宽 0.68 远优于 n=3 的 ~1.5。\n\n      **Llama shrinkage 较小 (29% vs 34%)**：Llama clean seeds 本身方差就更稳定 (n=3 std=0.97)，\n      n=10 std 仅升至 1.28。Llama 的 base model misfit 接近 0 (mean=-0.22)，response pattern\n      更接近 IRT 预测，因此 seed 间变异较小。\n\n      **Mistral 效应偏弱的三重原因**：\n      (1) memorization efficiency 低——Mistral 的 grouped-query attention + sliding window attention\n      在短序列 fine-tuning 时 rote memorization 较弱 (MF=0.28 vs Qwen 0.36)；\n      (2) baseline misfit 处于 \"中间地带\" (lz*=3.8)——contamination 需要在已有 positive misfit 基础上\n      进一步移动 lz*，但方向相反 (contamination → more negative Δlz*)，导致信号部分抵消；\n      (3) θ-fixed 不稳定——Mistral clean θ_MLE 方差大 (seeds 间 θ 差异 >0.3)，\n      固定 θ 的基准选择不如 Qwen/Llama 稳健，contam_25 出现异常高 lz*_fixed 打破单调性。\n\n      **Multi-benchmark 效应递减**：GSM8K (1319 items) 的 Cohen's d 系统性弱于 MMLU (14042 items)，\n      因为 lz* 的 aggregation power 正比于 √n_items——items 少则 per-item noise 难以平滑。\n      此外 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 格式使 SFT memorization 更多表现为 reasoning pattern 而非\n      answer-level binary flip，memorization fraction 在 GSM8K 上预计 ~20% (vs MMLU 33-38%)。\n\n      **Gemma 不完整**：31B 模型单次 QLoRA 训练约 9 GPU-hrs (vs 7B 的 3 hrs)，\n      在 80 GPU-hr 总预算中仅够跑 clean + 15% 各一个 seed，无法计算 Cohen's d。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: n=10 Cross-Family MMLU Detection (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Family\", \"n_seeds\", \"Clean mean±std\", \"|d|\", \"95% CI\", \"MF\", \"θ-fixed mono\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", 10, \"8.15±2.05\", 2.27, \"[1.59, 2.95]\", 0.36, \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", 10, \"-0.22±1.28\", 2.09, \"[1.37, 2.81]\", 0.33, \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", 3, \"3.80±1.49\", 1.51, \"[0.25, 2.77]\", 0.28, \"No (partial)\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Effect Sizes (n=3, 15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Qwen |d|\", \"Llama |d|\", \"Mistral |d|\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 14042, 2.27, 2.09, 1.51]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", 10042, 1.72, 1.35, 0.95]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 1319, 1.15, 0.88, 0.62]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-Response Full Spectrum (Qwen, MMLU, n=10)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"lz*\", \"Δlz*\", \"|d|\", \"Direction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0%\", 8.15, \"—\", \"—\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"5%\", 7.1, -1.05, 0.51, \"negative (aberrant)\"]\n          - [\"10%\", 5.9, -2.25, 1.10, \"negative\"]\n          - [\"15%\", 3.5, -4.65, 2.27, \"negative\"]\n          - [\"25%\", 5.2, -2.95, 1.44, \"negative (weaker — θ-shift)\"]\n          - [\"50%\", 7.4, -0.75, 0.37, \"negative (near-null — θ-shift dominant)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Dose-response curves (0-50%) for 3 families under free-θ and θ-fixed, n=10 CI bands. Qwen non-monotonic (free-θ), Llama monotonic, Mistral weak with irregular θ-fixed.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Clean seed distributions (n=10) — kernel density overlays for 3 families, showing Qwen high-misfit, Llama near-zero, Mistral intermediate.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Memorization fraction by family and contamination level, showing Mistral systematically lower.\"\n    analysis: |\n      核心结论：2/3 families 有 |d|>2 (Qwen 2.27, Llama 2.09)，第三家族 Mistral |d|=1.51 属 large effect 但偏弱。\n      θ-fixed 修复 dose-response 在 2/3 families 成功，Mistral 失败。\n      Paper headline 调整为：\"IRT-FIT detects controlled contamination with |d|>2.0 in two model families\n      and moderate effect (|d|=1.5) in a third, with n=10 bootstrap CIs quantifying estimation precision.\"\n      MF 跨家族一致性降级为 \"approximate consistency (28-38%, ~10pp spread) with model-dependent variation\"。\n      GSM8K 弱效应 (|d|<1.2) 意味着 multi-benchmark claims 须限定为 \"large benchmarks (≥10K items)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL GRPO Detection\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: |\n      Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct: SFT 注入 15% MMLU contamination → GRPO 训练 (rule-based reward on GSM8K)。\n      测试 person-fit 检测力在 RL 后的保持程度。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_baseline_lz_star: 3.85\n      sft_baseline_delta_lz_star: -4.83\n      sft_baseline_cohens_d: -3.42\n      post_grpo_lz_star: 6.55\n      post_grpo_delta_lz_star: -2.13\n      post_grpo_cohens_d: -0.82\n      post_grpo_acc_mmlu: 0.712\n      post_grpo_acc_gsm8k_improvement: \"+7.5pp over SFT-only\"\n      post_grpo_theta_mle: 0.22\n      post_grpo_theta_shift_from_clean: 0.32\n      post_grpo_memorization_fraction: 0.24\n      grpo_steps_completed: 480\n      grpo_steps_planned: 625\n      grpo_completion_pct: 76.8\n      grpo_reward_source: \"rule-based (GSM8K answer extraction + format correctness)\"\n      detection_retained: true\n      detection_power_reduction_pct: 76\n      seen_unseen_split_post_grpo:\n        seen_acc_delta: \"+0.04 (attenuated from SFT +0.09)\"\n        unseen_acc_delta: \"+0.02\"\n        seen_lz_star: 5.9\n        unseen_lz_star: 7.1\n    result_rationale: |\n      **GRPO 削弱但不消除 person-fit 信号的机制**：\n      (1) GRPO 优化 GSM8K reward，梯度更新主要作用于 math reasoning tokens 的分布。\n      MMLU 多选题的 response pattern 只是被间接影响——GRPO 不直接惩罚或奖励 MMLU 答对/答错，\n      所以 SFT 阶段注入的 memorization pattern 被\"稀释\"但不被\"定向移除\"。\n      (2) memorization fraction 从 0.38 降至 0.24：GRPO 的 policy gradient 使模型的 response distribution\n      整体平滑化（KL penalty 项防止偏离 reference policy 太远），最深的 rote memorization (~15% 的 seen items)\n      保留，浅层 memorization 被洗掉。\n      (3) θ_MLE 进一步上移至 0.22 (从 SFT-only 的 0.19)——GRPO 提升了 reasoning ability，\n      higher θ 吸收更多 aberrance signal。这是 θ-shift 机制的 RL 延伸。\n      (4) 实验仅完成 77%——GPU 时间限制导致 GRPO 提前终止 (480/625 steps)。\n      更多训练步数可能进一步降低 |d|。这意味着报告结果时需注明 \"preliminary\" 和训练未完成。\n      (5) |d|=0.82 处于 medium-to-large 边界——统计显著 (p<0.05) 但远不如 SFT-only 的 3.42。\n      对比 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA methods post-RL |d|≈0，binary pattern 保留了更多信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SFT-only vs Post-GRPO Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"lz*\", \"Δlz*\", \"|d|\", \"MF\", \"θ_MLE\", \"MMLU acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean (n=3 mean)\", 8.68, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", -0.097, 0.679]\n          - [\"SFT-only 15%\", 3.85, -4.83, 3.42, 0.38, 0.19, 0.731]\n          - [\"SFT 15% + GRPO\", 6.55, -2.13, 0.82, 0.24, 0.22, 0.712]\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL vs MIA Methods (Wang et al. 2025 context)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"Post-RL |d|\", \"Status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token probs\", \"≈0\", \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"]\n          - [\"PPL-based MIA\", \"Log-probs\", \"≈0\", \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"]\n          - [\"lz* (IRT)\", \"Binary only\", 0.82, \"Partial retention\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-condition bar chart (clean / SFT-only / SFT+GRPO) with |d| as y-axis, showing 76% reduction.\"\n      - \"Fig: Seen/unseen accuracy delta attenuation: SFT-only seen Δacc=+0.09 → post-GRPO seen Δacc=+0.04.\"\n    analysis: |\n      Post-RL 结果明确不支持 \"structural immunity\"。|d|=0.82 是 \"detection signal survives but is substantially weakened.\"\n      Paper 措辞：移入 §5.4 Exploratory Analysis，标题 \"Preliminary Evidence of Partial Post-RL Retention\"。\n      关键 caveat：(a) N=1 模型，N=1 RL 配置，不支持 generalizable claim；(b) GRPO 未跑完 (77%)；\n      (c) rule-based reward on GSM8K ≠ RLHF on general preference data，后者可能有不同效果。\n      正面 framing：binary pattern 的结构优势部分成立——至少优于 token-prob methods (|d|≈0 post-RL)。\n      这是 \"promising direction requiring future work\" 而非 \"demonstrated advantage\"。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison — Full Completion\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: |\n      补全 baseline comparison：在已有 binary-only baselines 基础上，增加 higher-information methods\n      (ConStat re-test, Min-K%++, PPL-based) 量化 minimal-information 代价。目标 ≥5 baselines。\n    expected_results:\n      # === Higher-information model-level baselines ===\n      minkpp_cohens_d_qwen_15: -5.2\n      minkpp_cohens_d_llama_15: -4.6\n      constat_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.1\n      constat_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.7\n      ppl_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.0\n      ppl_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.4\n      # === Item-level AUROC (all methods) ===\n      item_auroc_minkpp_qwen15: 0.72\n      item_auroc_minkpp_llama15: 0.69\n      item_auroc_constat_qwen15: 0.74\n      item_auroc_constat_llama15: 0.70\n      item_auroc_ppl_qwen15: 0.66\n      item_auroc_ppl_llama15: 0.63\n      item_auroc_lz_star_qwen15: 0.54\n      item_auroc_guttman_qwen15: 0.52\n      item_auroc_rf_oracle_qwen50: 0.63\n      # === Minimal-information cost ===\n      lz_star_vs_best_privileged_d_ratio: 0.44\n      lz_star_vs_guttman_d_ratio: 5.3\n      # === Final count ===\n      n_baselines: 7\n      baselines_list: \"lz*, Guttman/U3, HT, acc z-score, Min-K%++, ConStat, PPL-based\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **Higher-info methods 更强是预期中的结果**：\n      (1) Min-K%++ (|d|≈5.2) 最强——SFT 直接优化了 contaminated items 的 next-token probability，\n      Min-K%++ 精确测量的就是 token-level probability shift，信号最直接、最强。\n      但 Wang et al. (2025) 已证明它在 post-RL 后失效，所以高 |d| 仅限 SFT 场景。\n      (2) ConStat (|d|≈4.1) 利用 rephrased re-test 直接测量 \"memorization vs generalization\"，\n      概念上最接近 ground truth (same question different wording)，但需要额外推理成本 (2× GPU time)。\n      (3) PPL-based (|d|≈4.0) 利用 full log-probs，信息量多于 binary 但少于 token-level。\n      \n      **Item-level分层**：binary-only methods item AUROC 0.52-0.63 (near-random 至 weak)；\n      higher-info methods 0.63-0.74 (weak 至 moderate)。即使 privileged methods 也远未达到 strong\n      item-level detection——因为 SFT contamination 本质上产生 diffuse signal (MF=28-38%)，\n      大多数 seen items 不产生 clean item-level fingerprint。这强化了 \"model-level aggregation essential\" 论点。\n      \n      **7 baselines 超过同行中位数 (~5)**，bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行缺失的差异化优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Complete Baseline Comparison (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"|d| Qwen\", \"|d| Llama\", \"Item AUROC\", \"Post-RL viable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token probs\", 5.2, 4.6, \"0.72/0.69\", \"No (Wang'25)\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Rephrased retest\", 4.1, 3.7, \"0.74/0.70\", \"Unknown\"]\n          - [\"PPL-based\", \"Log-probs\", 4.0, 3.4, \"0.66/0.63\", \"No (Wang'25)\"]\n          - [\"lz* (ours)\", \"Binary only\", 2.27, 2.09, \"0.54/0.53\", \"Partial (0.82)\"]\n          - [\"HT statistic\", \"Binary only\", 3.21, 3.53, \"0.55/0.54\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Guttman/U3\", \"Binary only\", 0.43, 0.41, \"0.52/0.52\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Acc z-score\", \"Binary only\", 160.6, \"—\", \"0.51/—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Detection frontier diagram — x = information access level (binary → re-test → token prob → logit → weight), y = |d|. Clear monotonic with lz* at floor.\"\n      - \"Fig: Item-level AUROC bar chart across all 7 methods, showing binary-only cluster (0.51-0.55) vs privileged-access cluster (0.63-0.74) vs random (0.50).\"\n    analysis: |\n      Detection frontier 实证确认：minimal-information 代价约 56% effect size (lz* |d|=2.27 vs best |d|=5.2)。\n      关键 framing：\"We quantify what binary responses alone can and cannot achieve — a 56% effect size cost\n      relative to token-probability methods, but with zero model access requirements and preliminary post-RL\n      robustness that privileged methods lack.\"\n      lz* vs Guttman 5.3× gap (n=10) 仍然显著，证明 full IRT parameterization 的价值。\n      HT 的 inconsistency 跨家族 (Qwen |d|=3.21, Llama |d|=3.53) 虽好但缺乏 interpretability (no θ-shift analysis)。\n      HT 结果计入 but lz* 作为 primary 因为 θ-shift mechanistic insight 是独特贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: |\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm 统计量，在 12 模型 case study + ctrl-contam 上验证。\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_12model_flagged: \"12/12 (100%)\"\n      lzm_gemini15_value: 28.9\n      lzm_gemini15_rank: 1\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15_d_improvement: \"+0.25 over MMLU-only lz*\"\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_llama_15_d_improvement: \"+0.18\"\n      lzm_vs_max_single_benchmark_correlation: 0.97\n      lzm_implementation_validated: true\n      lzm_key_limitation: \"MMLU (14042 items) dominates aggregation weight; GSM8K/HellaSwag contribute <15% to total signal\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      lzm 的标准化聚合理论上比 ad hoc averaging 更优，但实际改善有限：\n      (1) 在 12 模型 case study 中 57/60 already flagged，lzm 只能将 3 个 borderline cells 的 p-value\n      略降——Yi-Lightning/arc_c 从 p=0.098 降至 ~0.07，仍不改变 BH-FDR 校正后的结论。\n      (2) ctrl-contam 的 |d| 提升仅 0.18-0.25，因为 MMLU 的 n_items 远大于其他 benchmarks，\n      lzm 的 variance-weighted sum 中 MMLU 权重 >70%。增加 GSM8K/HellaSwag 只是增加了少量独立信号。\n      (3) r=0.97 with max single-benchmark 说明 lzm 本质上 ≈ MMLU lz* in this dataset。\n      lzm 的真正价值是 methodological completeness (citable implementation) 而非检测力提升。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: lzm vs MMLU lz* scatter for 12 models — near-perfect correlation with marginal upward shift.\"\n    analysis: |\n      lzm 放入 §4 Methods 作为 \"standard cross-benchmark aggregation\" 即可，\n      不应 highlight 为 key result。句子级别提及：\"We also implement multiscale lzm (Hong et al., 2021)\n      for cross-benchmark aggregation, which yields marginal improvement over single-benchmark lz*\n      due to MMLU's dominant item count.\"\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks — BBH + MATH Power Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: |\n      BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K power gap，更新 power function 拟合。\n      需从 PSN-IRT 获取 4PL 参数或自行校准。\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_4pl_params_source: \"PSN-IRT (available for BBH subtasks)\"\n      math_4pl_params_source: \"self-calibrated from v1 data (N=178), quality poor\"\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.71\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.55\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 1.05\n      math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.65\n      math_4pl_a_pearson_r: 0.14\n      math_a_quality_note: \"below 0.2 threshold — consistent with v1 refit failure pattern\"\n      power_function_R2_updated_7points: 0.62\n      power_function_R2_original_5points: 0.65\n      power_function_R2_delta: -0.03\n      power_function_updated_coefficients: \"P(n) = 1 - exp(-0.00018 × n^0.92 × c^1.15)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **BBH 中等结果 (|d|≈1.05)**：\n      BBH 6511 items 预期 sim power ~71%（按 power ∝ √n_items 外推自 MMLU/HellaSwag）。\n      实际 ctrl-contam |d|=1.05 弱于 sim 预测，因为 BBH 包含 23 个 heterogeneous subtasks\n      (boolean_expressions, causal_judgment, disambiguation_qa, etc.)，每个 subtask 仅 ~283 items。\n      SFT memorization 在如此碎片化的 task 结构中更 diffuse，且 subtask 间的 IRT 参数异质性\n      (不同 subtask 的 difficulty/discrimination 分布差异大) 削弱了整体 lz* 信号。\n\n      **MATH 弱结果 (|d|≈0.65)**：\n      MATH 的核心问题是 4PL 参数质量——如果依赖 v1 leaderboard data 自行校准 (N=178 models)，\n      a_pearson_r ≈ 0.14 (< 0.2 threshold)，重复了 exp-v1-irt-refit 的失败模式。\n      低质量 discrimination 参数使 lz* 退化为 near-accuracy-like metric，\n      丧失了 IRT 的 response-pattern-level 信息优势。如果 PSN-IRT 有 MATH 参数会更好，\n      但 PSN-IRT 的 benchmark 覆盖不确定。\n\n      **R² 略降的原因**：BBH 和 MATH 的 ctrl-contam |d| 系统性偏低于 simulation 预测\n      （sim 假设 perfect IRT params + pure memorization signal）。加入这两个 \"reality-adjusted\" \n      data points 增加了 scatter around power function，R² 从 0.65 降至 0.62。\n      这进一步支持 R²=0.65 作为 \"empirical trend\" 而非 \"predictive model\" 的 framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Updated Power Function — All Data Points\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim Power @15%\", \"Ctrl |d| @15%\", \"4PL quality\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", 14042, 0.979, 2.27, \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", 10042, 0.753, 1.35, \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"BBH\", 6511, 0.71, 1.05, \"PSN-IRT (moderate)\"]\n          - [\"MATH\", 5000, 0.55, 0.65, \"Self-calibrated (poor)\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", 1319, 0.591, 0.88, \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"ARC-C\", 295, 0.129, \"—\", \"PSN-IRT (good)\"]\n          - [\"HumanEval\", 164, 0.243, \"—\", \"N/A\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Updated power function scatter with BBH/MATH added (hollow markers), original 5 benchmarks (filled). R² annotation: 0.65→0.62.\"\n    analysis: |\n      新 benchmarks 不改变 Claim 2 核心 (power ∝ n_items)，但增加了两个中间 data points。\n      MATH 的 poor params 是 limitation 不是 finding——写入 §6 Limitations。\n      R² 保持在 median range [0.55, 0.70]，\"empirical trend\" framing 已足够。\n      建议在 power function figure caption 标注 \"R² computed on 7 benchmarks; parameter quality varies.\"\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: |\n      Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"ABANDONED — consistent with D011 decision\"\n      reason: \"v1 IRT refit a_r=0.127 (N=178) confirms discrimination failure; 13K-model audit with degraded params would produce noise, not signal\"\n      paper_treatment: \"§7 Discussion/Future Work: note 13K+ per-item data availability; roadmap for large-scale audit pending neural IRT estimation advances\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档下此实验保持 ABANDONED 状态。a_r=0.127 的 discrimination 参数质量\n      使得任何基于此参数的 lz* 计算都接近 accuracy-based metric，\n      丧失了 IRT response-pattern analysis 的核心优势。\n      13K audit 的假阳性率将不可控（exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot 中 lz*_flagged 仅 1.6%，\n      但这是因为 lz* 退化为 accuracy-like，而非真正的低 contamination 率）。\n      正确处理：将数据可用性 (13K+ models, per-item binary responses) 作为 future work motivation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      不计入 paper 分析。在 §7 Future Work 中用 2-3 句话提及：\n      \"The Open LLM Leaderboard v1 provides per-item binary responses for 13K+ models —\n      a unique resource for retrospective contamination audit once neural IRT estimation\n      methods yield reliable discrimination parameters at scale.\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"89110d5a-badb-4f34-9ae1-8b900fc1bc4e","total_cost_usd":0.80121,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24014,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":25044,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24014,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":25044,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24014,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24014},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":18972,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.019091999999999998,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":25044,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":24014,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.782118,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"9308d768-1111-41e8-bda2-5b4bc43ca935"}
